        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8051AS, Traditional Clear Crystal Astoria with Rope Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBy itself, this exquisite Astoria crystal knob is indeed beautiful; but when paired with Emtek's classic Rope Rosette, the knob is even more gorgeous. Available in a wide array of finishes, this Crystal Clear Knob is a great way to add old world allure to any home. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The Astoria Clear Crystal Knob with Rope Rosette is easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors. Choose from dummy passage, or privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Astoria Door Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Astoria Knob and Rope Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Stem: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-7-finish.jpg?v=1704354517\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
