                "title": "Astoria Clear Crystal Knob with Rope Rosette",
                "description": "By itself, this exquisite Astoria crystal knob is indeed beautiful; but when paired with Emtek's classic Rope Rosette, the knob is even more gorgeous. Available in a wide array of finishes, this Crystal Clear Knob is a great way to add old world allure to any home. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The Astoria Clear Crystal Knob with Rope Rosette is easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors. Choose from dummy passage, or privacy functions.\r\n",
